        "description": {
            "value": "<p>The target's feet glow with a magical flame that lingers and grows on the ground where they walk, creating a line of blazing fire as they move. The first time the target Strides during the spell's duration, they leave behind a trail made of magical fire that fills up each space they occupied during that Stride. This fire is 5 feet high. Creatures on either side of the trail are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Concealed] from creatures on the opposite side. Any creature that enters or starts its turn in the trail's area takes 2d10 fire damage.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The fire damage increases by 1d10.</p>"
